From d85916990edd33b40ac24490696600cb036a9c1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:00:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] test-posix: Check getgrnam, getgrgid and their
 reentrant forms

errno is left alone when nothing matches, member lists hold no empty
names, ERANGE comes only from a buffer too small for the entry found,
the name and member array lie in the buffer,
sysconf(_SC_GETGR_R_SIZE_MAX) answers, and EMFILE is reported.
---
 test/test-posix/test-grp/CMakeLists.txt    |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-grp/meson.build       |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-grp/test-getgrgid_r.c |  78 ++++++++-
 test/test-posix/test-grp/test-getgrnam.c   | 195 +++++++++++++++++++++
 test/test-posix/test-grp/test-getgrnam_r.c |  75 +++++++-
 5 files changed, 337 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 test/test-posix/test-grp/test-getgrnam.c

